# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Innovo Xpress — Driver app
#
# Four values, and no more. EXPO_PUBLIC_* are inlined into the JavaScript bundle
# at build time, so NEVER put a secret here — the publishable key is designed to
# be public, a service-role key is not.
#
# Anything that is a contract with the backend rather than a per-deployment
# choice lives in code instead (see src/lib/env.ts): the reporting interval and
# the GPS distance filter used to be here, and configurability only ever meant a
# way to break tracking from a text file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The Express API.
#
# LEAVE EMPTY IN DEVELOPMENT. The app derives the host from Metro — which the
# phone is provably already reaching — so a new DHCP lease cannot break it.
# Set it only to point somewhere else (staging, a tunnel, another machine) or
# for a release build, which has no Metro to ask.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# Supabase Auth. The app signs in directly and the API only ever verifies.
# Blank BOTH to run the app on built-in demo data with no backend at all.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<publishable-key>

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build-time only — read by app.config.ts, NOT inlined as EXPO_PUBLIC_.
#
# Android only. Google Maps refuses to inflate without a key, and the crash
# cannot be caught from JS; leave it empty and the screens show a labelled
# placeholder instead of dying (src/lib/mapsConfig.ts). iOS needs no key at all:
# both map screens pass PROVIDER_DEFAULT, which on iOS is Apple Maps.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis — enable
# "Maps SDK for Android", then Credentials -> Create credentials -> API key.
# Adding it needs a NATIVE REBUILD (npx expo run:android), not a Metro restart:
# it is compiled into AndroidManifest.xml.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_ANDROID=
